          "version": "nkt-031",
          "changelog": "Nikita firmware nkt-031. Nikita Agent Service (headless control plane): mailbox /ext/nikita/agent/req->res (bridge-free) + nagent CLI; core sys.* ops. Foundation for programmable control of every Flipper subsystem.",
